commit_template_hash: 686bd6f6d3f60a9716f8ca85195b61c4852e2e6d8a91cf7a01fc867d6252a9af
intent: Harness fix: both loop-based dispatchers (_lease_gated_dispatch, run_footprint_gated) leaked their inflight entry when a worker died on any exception other than RateLimitAbort (observed 2026-08-27, nool_try N=35: wedged nool release call after promote raised TimeoutExpired; admission loop then skipped refused tickets forever at ~0% CPU). Workers now catch agent-phase and integrate-phase exceptions, record them in the run record, and always release the admission lease + advance the epoch + drop inflight in a finally block. Killed run fleet_nool_try_7e2b4da7 (45/60 transcripts, never recorded) was discarded, not landed. Likely explains the undiagnosed 2026-08-26 N=25 57/60 hang.
knot_id: fc1c452f2fc4220dac5fd290ac4652f62e392a0d542628980d0a489e9f98b2af
